        "Absolutely. We frequently take on new clients partway through their accounting or tax year and will work with your existing records to get you up to date quickly.",
        "All of our core services are fixed-fee, agreed before we start any work. Ad hoc advisory projects, such as a one-off restructuring exercise, are quoted separately and agreed in advance.",
        "Yes. Harrison James is a registered ICAEW practice, we hold professional indemnity insurance, and we're registered with the ICO for data protection."
